@startuml
actor Operador
participant "Siv.Desktop" as Desktop
participant "Siv.Api.Desktop" as ApiD
participant "Siv.Application" as App
database "Persistence" as DB
participant "Siv.Api.Web" as ApiW
participant "Siv.Web" as Web

Operador -> Desktop: Solicitar cambio
Desktop -> ApiD: POST /api/cambiosoperativos
ApiD -> App: Ejecutar caso de uso
App -> App: Validar permisos y dominio
App -> DB: Guardar vuelo, cambio y auditoría
App -> DB: Crear notificaciones
ApiD -> ApiW: Difundir cambio
ApiW -> Web: Publicar evento SignalR
ApiD --> Desktop: DTO del cambio
@enduml
